lems with this game have now been fixed, the only problem with this game is the lack of available players to match.", "timestamp_created": 1732974236, "timestamp_updated": 1732974236, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "181049012", "author": {"steamid": "76561198020116139", "personaname": "Prime", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198020116139/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 1964, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1834, "deck_playtime_at_review": 426, "last_played": 1777571289, "avatar": "845092e3ae484c0f0454d67b8bd1e491faab9a62"}, "language": "english", "review": "Для фанатов Aliens однозначно советую, очень приятная игра", "timestamp_created": 1732973000, "timestamp_updated": 1732973000, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "180967302", "author": {"steamid": "76561197997753906", "personaname": "Toxxix", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197997753906/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 2035, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2035, "last_played": 1731653199, "avatar": "c8c8695b07d359d7cb7ddfe828902b5c0b55a7b9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Should have picked this up sooner! Aliens: Fireteam Elite is a fun horde shooter with satisfying combat and a great atmosphere. The music, maps, and weapons all capture